503
00:29:37.700 --> 00:29:39.702
<i>a self-guided spacewalk.</i>

504
00:29:47.418 --> 00:29:50.171
<i>Welcome to
the Olarun Four,</i>

505
00:29:50.254 --> 00:29:53.257
<i>your home for the next 35 days.</i>

506
00:29:53.341 --> 00:29:55.760
<i>I'm self-made
billionaire Leon Kovi</i>

507
00:29:55.843 --> 00:29:58.638
<i>and I cannot wait to meet you on Mars.</i>

508
00:29:59.639 --> 00:30:01.015
<i>You did it! You're on the ship!</i>

509
00:30:01.098 --> 00:30:03.518
- <i>Yay, Sophie!</i>
