536
00:31:27.435 --> 00:31:29.687
You text Ginny, anyone, you...

537
00:31:30.563 --> 00:31:34.025
We get caught.

538
00:31:34.108 --> 00:31:35.860
Then let's get in
the air ducts.

539
00:31:37.486 --> 00:31:39.322
