553
00:32:16.233 --> 00:32:17.860
- Who is that?
- That's Cornelia.

554
00:32:17.944 --> 00:32:19.862
Complimentary AI
for the journey.

555
00:32:19.946 --> 00:32:22.073
And I'm your captain, Tarter.

556
00:32:22.156 --> 00:32:23.532
Captain Tarter.

557
00:32:26.410 --> 00:32:28.037
Calvin.

558
00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:30.498
