Come meet your new neighbors.

570
00:33:01.278 --> 00:33:03.280
Hello. I'm Tabby.

571
00:33:03.364 --> 00:33:05.866
- This is Celeste.
- Hi. I'm Celeste.

572
00:33:05.950 --> 00:33:07.827
- Sophie.
- Calvin.

573
00:33:07.910 --> 00:33:09.870
- I'm a scientist.
- Engineer.

574
00:33:09.954 --> 00:33:12.248
- Double threat.
- Enough shoptalk.

575
00:33:12.331 --> 00:33:15.793
Tabby and Celeste over here,
