644
00:36:36.577 --> 00:36:38.996
You can't hold
your liquor.

645
00:36:41.582 --> 00:36:42.583
Uh...

646
00:36:43.209 --> 00:36:44.084
Earl...

647
00:36:51.550 --> 00:36:52.843
Oh!

648
00:36:53.719 --> 00:36:54.720
All right.

649
00:36:55.679 --> 00:36:57.181
Soft reboot, Earl.

650
00:36:57.264 --> 00:36:59.433
