666
00:37:35.678 --> 00:37:38.597
Okay. Amazing. Wow. My heart is racing.
What are we doing next?

667
00:37:38.681 --> 00:37:39.765
Next? We lay low.

668
00:37:39.848 --> 00:37:42.184
What? No.
Oh, my heart.

