675
00:37:52.945 --> 00:37:54.154
Okay. We need a routine.

676
00:37:54.238 --> 00:37:57.074
Be seen enough
not to draw attention.

677
00:37:57.825 --> 00:37:59.368
Oh, here we go.

678
00:37:59.451 --> 00:38:01.870
A lecture series by a few of
