- Soft maybe.

681
00:38:04.581 --> 00:38:07.167
Food tube cooking, spacewalk...

682
00:38:07.251 --> 00:38:08.335
Spacewalk?

683
00:38:08.419 --> 00:38:10.004
No. You need a partner for that

684
00:38:10.087 --> 00:38:12.673
