685
00:38:12.756 --> 00:38:15.676
Come on, Sophie.
We are in the clear.

686
00:38:15.759 --> 00:38:17.136
Let's go have some fun.

687
00:38:17.219 --> 00:38:18.345
We're not gonna get caught.

688
00:38:18.429 --> 00:38:20.389
