689
00:38:20.472 --> 00:38:21.640
Check it. Cornelia?

690
00:38:21.724 --> 00:38:23.183
Greetings, Calvin-Walt.

691
00:38:23.267 --> 00:38:24.977
Nope. Just Calvin.

692
00:38:25.060 --> 00:38:27.271
Cornelia, wasn't there
