705
00:38:53.213 --> 00:38:54.048
The PG ones.

706
00:38:54.131 --> 00:38:56.175
You mean the boring ones.

707
00:38:56.258 --> 00:38:58.886
Cornelia,
please dim the lights.

708
00:39:02.306 --> 00:39:04.516
This is gonna suck, isn't it?

709
00:39:04.600 --> 00:39:06.435
Only for 35 days.

710
00:39:16.278 --> 00:39:19.365
We can do quizzes
at 7:00 a.m. and 8:00 p.m.

711
00:39:19.448 --> 00:39:21.450
