- Yes!

712
00:39:21.533 --> 00:39:22.576
What about...

713
00:39:22.659 --> 00:39:24.119
personal intimacy time?

714
00:39:24.203 --> 00:39:26.246
We share that room.

715
00:39:26.330 --> 00:39:28.957
Exercise some self-control.

716
00:39:36.131 --> 00:39:38.300
<i>Hey, there she is.</i>

717
00:39:38.384 --> 00:39:40.761
- <i>Sorry, do we have a call scheduled?</i>
